  "details": "Description\n\nThe profile picture taken using the VRC camera does not save between sessions. It will reset everytime I log out and log back in, meaning I have to set it back everytime. The picture itself is still available.\n\nI expected this setting to save permanently, until I change it.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nSet a profile picture via the VRC camera, save it. Log out and back in again, and it will be reset to the current avatar's picture.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1886-a268441585-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
